  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender training Kos/Mac - Gender traininglocal cost</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gender utbildning Kos/Mak</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender training for the cooperating partners in Kosovo has been recognized as an important action in order to improve the mainstreaming of a gender equality perspective in the Sida-financed project and programmes in Kosovo. Two training seminars will therefore be held in Pristina-Kosovo for that purpose.The seminars include training for Sida-staff in Pristina and Skopje.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">J&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhetsutbildning f&#xF6;r de implementerande parterna i Kosovo har definierats som en viktig del f&#xF6;r att &#xF6;ka kvalit&#xE9;n i de Sidafinansierade projekten. Tv&#xE5; seminarier kommer d&#xE4;rf&#xF6;r h&#xE5;llas i Pristina-Kosovo. Seminarierna inkluderar utbildning f&#xF6;r Sidapersonal i Pristina och Skopje.</narrative>
  </description>
